WEBVTT

01:41.900 --> 01:48.830
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.490 --> 01:51.930
[Episode 19]

02:29.240 --> 02:30.040
You're awake.

02:32.310 --> 02:33.840
You seem to have a low fever.

02:34.430 --> 02:35.960
Have some warm sugar water.

02:37.560 --> 02:38.590
I can do it myself.

02:41.840 --> 02:42.590
Let me.

03:20.310 --> 03:21.110
It's just that

03:21.590 --> 03:22.920
my blood sugar dropped.

03:23.430 --> 03:24.690
Don't worry about me.

03:27.470 --> 03:29.200
I'm going to get you something.

04:36.560 --> 04:37.190
Is this

04:38.430 --> 04:39.430
where you live?

04:42.600 --> 04:43.659
Isn't it good here?

04:45.070 --> 04:46.070
It's pretty cool.

04:56.630 --> 04:57.560
So these are

04:58.510 --> 04:59.710
what you usually eat?

05:04.190 --> 05:05.920
Sometimes I'm too lazy to cook.

05:06.630 --> 05:08.560
It's more convenient to eat these.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.120
Have you...

05:33.430 --> 05:35.240
Have you suffered a lot?

05:39.600 --> 05:40.380
Nope.

05:42.240 --> 05:43.500
I'm doing pretty well.

05:44.360 --> 05:45.190
As a guy,

05:46.480 --> 05:48.540
I don't care much about these things.

05:55.800 --> 05:57.240
What do you do now?

06:03.510 --> 06:05.570
I make handmade speakers for people.

06:06.950 --> 06:08.610
Occasionally, there are also

06:08.630 --> 06:10.090
some weird custom orders.

06:10.950 --> 06:12.610
You could say I'm a craftsman.

06:14.040 --> 06:15.500
Which school did you go to?

06:21.370 --> 06:23.030
I have a self-taught diploma.

06:24.040 --> 06:25.570
I won't mention the school.

06:25.600 --> 06:27.920
It's not important in our industry anyway.

06:27.920 --> 06:30.180
It's fine
as long as the work is done well.

06:36.040 --> 06:36.840
What about me?

06:37.430 --> 06:39.159
Why don't you ask how I'm doing?

06:41.270 --> 06:41.920
You...

06:44.600 --> 06:45.730
must be doing great.

06:47.630 --> 06:48.920
You are Lin Zhixia.

06:50.360 --> 06:52.620
I'm sure a bachelor's, Master's, or Ph.D

06:53.310 --> 06:54.970
wouldn't be a problem for you.

06:56.600 --> 06:57.530
You must be young

06:58.920 --> 07:00.720
but highly respected at school.

07:01.630 --> 07:02.430
Now you've

07:04.630 --> 07:06.360
really grown into a young lady.

07:08.080 --> 07:10.140
Then why have you never contacted us?

07:15.560 --> 07:16.920
They are all so smart.

07:18.040 --> 07:20.170
They must've gotten into good schools

07:21.600 --> 07:22.860
and had great futures.

07:24.160 --> 07:25.020
What about you?

07:25.630 --> 07:26.830
What about yourself?

07:27.360 --> 07:29.360
How have you been these past 5 years?

07:30.420 --> 07:31.070
I...

07:33.920 --> 07:35.520
I'm different from you guys.

07:37.920 --> 07:39.180
You've been studying.

07:40.830 --> 07:42.560
I've just been making a living.

07:44.050 --> 07:46.800
You...
You know that's not what I want to hear.

07:50.060 --> 07:50.670
You...

07:52.230 --> 07:54.430
You should have something to eat first.

07:58.630 --> 08:00.030
Can we not talk about this

08:01.160 --> 08:01.950
for now?

08:07.070 --> 08:07.870
Jiang Yubai,

08:09.040 --> 08:10.160
I just want to know

08:10.680 --> 08:12.610
how you've been these past 5 years,

08:13.160 --> 08:14.760
and what happened 5 years ago

08:15.160 --> 08:17.160
that made you disappear all of a sudden.

08:17.160 --> 08:18.750
None of us could find you.

08:18.770 --> 08:20.120
Why did you hide from us?

08:23.390 --> 08:25.520
I'm right in front of you now, aren't I?

08:26.070 --> 08:28.070
Everything is exactly as you see it.

08:28.280 --> 08:31.010
What's the point
of getting to the bottom of this?

08:35.320 --> 08:37.600
Do you know that
you disappeared for 5 years?

08:37.600 --> 08:38.789
For 5 whole years!

08:39.870 --> 08:41.360
I've been looking for you
for 5 whole years!

08:41.360 --> 08:43.360
It's been so long, Jiang Yubai!

08:46.630 --> 08:48.490
Do you even see us as your friends?

08:49.320 --> 08:51.440
What are we to you anyway?

08:54.390 --> 08:55.720
You were looking for me.

08:56.840 --> 08:59.970
Did I have to appear
just because you were looking for me?

09:02.550 --> 09:03.360
Lin Zhixia,

09:05.390 --> 09:06.790
you're not just a genius.

09:08.910 --> 09:10.170
You are also like a sun.

09:12.080 --> 09:12.870
Pure,

09:14.120 --> 09:14.910
bright,

09:16.960 --> 09:17.840
and shining.

09:20.030 --> 09:21.230
You shine so brightly

09:22.440 --> 09:23.390
and warm others.

09:25.750 --> 09:28.150
But not everyone can keep shining forever,

09:28.840 --> 09:30.150
just like you.

09:31.720 --> 09:32.750
At least I can't.

09:36.440 --> 09:37.720
But I've found you now.

09:38.750 --> 09:40.150
We can face it together.

09:44.320 --> 09:46.250
This world is really complicated.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.270
There are dark places

09:51.600 --> 09:53.530
where even your light can't reach.

09:53.630 --> 09:55.120
I can help you.

09:55.840 --> 09:58.240
How would you know?
You haven't even tried.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.740
I don't need your help.

10:01.910 --> 10:03.510
And you can't help me anyway.

10:05.390 --> 10:06.650
This is my own business

10:07.030 --> 10:08.690
and has nothing to do with you.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.730
It has nothing to do with me?

10:17.270 --> 10:18.000
Yes,

10:19.120 --> 10:20.980
it does have nothing to do with me.

10:22.670 --> 10:24.550
Then what does this watch
have to do with you?

10:24.550 --> 10:25.720
Why did you fix it?

10:25.840 --> 10:26.870
You had been hiding for 5 years!

10:26.870 --> 10:28.200
Why did you show up now?

10:28.870 --> 10:30.840
Why didn't you just keep hiding?

10:31.080 --> 10:31.720
Yes!

10:33.000 --> 10:34.800
Yeah, I shouldn't have fixed it.

10:34.840 --> 10:35.630
I'm an idiot.

10:36.150 --> 10:37.150
Are you happy now?

10:38.630 --> 10:39.720
My biggest regret now is

10:39.720 --> 10:41.390
ever fixing this stupid watch.

10:41.390 --> 10:43.320
I should never have let you find me!

10:54.230 --> 10:56.650
[Peng]

10:59.260 --> 10:59.940
[Peng]

11:09.320 --> 11:10.850
I have something to handle.

11:12.870 --> 11:14.070
You should leave now.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.000
You drove me away.

11:48.510 --> 11:49.320
Fine.

11:52.360 --> 11:53.910
I know you live here now.

11:54.630 --> 11:56.230
You can't hide away anymore.

12:41.030 --> 12:42.000
Look at you.

12:42.270 --> 12:43.470
You're bold now, huh?

12:43.780 --> 12:45.510
You even dare to reject my call.

12:47.000 --> 12:48.200
I was outside just now

12:48.320 --> 12:49.520
and couldn't answer.

12:51.150 --> 12:53.390
But, Peng, I've paid this month's money.

12:53.390 --> 12:54.150
I know.

12:54.550 --> 12:56.210
I've never asked you for more.

12:57.320 --> 12:59.550
But with the bank
raising interest rates now,

12:59.550 --> 13:01.330
my rates are also going up.

13:01.510 --> 13:02.960
So starting next month,

13:03.080 --> 13:05.770
your interest will be increased by 3%.

13:06.360 --> 13:07.120
Wait...

13:09.120 --> 13:11.280
The interest rate was
already raised before.

13:11.280 --> 13:13.000
And it's already pretty high.

13:13.720 --> 13:14.920
If you raise it again,

13:15.080 --> 13:16.610
won't it just become usury?

13:17.120 --> 13:18.000
Jiang,

13:18.790 --> 13:20.090
you can't say that.

13:20.630 --> 13:22.600
When your mother's scandal
blew up back then,

13:22.600 --> 13:24.400
with such a huge financial hole,

13:24.510 --> 13:27.370
would any normal institution
have given you a loan?

13:27.410 --> 13:29.650
If I hadn't reached out to help
because I thought you were young

13:29.650 --> 13:30.720
and promising,

13:31.030 --> 13:33.030
you'd still be hiding somewhere.

13:33.720 --> 13:36.180
Got it? I was helping you
in your hour of need.

13:38.440 --> 13:39.840
I'm also having a hard time now.

13:39.840 --> 13:40.960
With inflation

13:40.960 --> 13:43.000
and a bunch of bad debts out there
that can't be collected,

13:43.000 --> 13:45.390
shouldn't you try to understand me a bit?

13:54.750 --> 13:57.080
If you think
the interest rate is too high,

13:57.720 --> 13:58.720
I have a solution.

14:00.240 --> 14:01.770
I have a few games next week.

14:02.890 --> 14:04.090
You come with me.

14:04.840 --> 14:06.790
You're brainy.

14:06.870 --> 14:08.130
Help me count cards,

14:08.440 --> 14:10.320
and the interest will stay the same.

14:10.320 --> 14:11.030
How's that?

14:12.000 --> 14:12.640
Peng.

14:14.360 --> 14:15.960
It is only natural to pay off debts.

14:15.960 --> 14:18.270
I'll pay every bit of interest
I'm supposed to.

14:18.270 --> 14:20.200
But I'm staying out of other stuff.

14:20.790 --> 14:22.250
I can't help you with this.

14:29.550 --> 14:30.150
Very well.

14:31.130 --> 14:32.390
You've got some nerve.

14:32.720 --> 14:34.390
Well, then, starting next month,

14:34.390 --> 14:35.870
the interest rate will go up by 3%.

14:35.870 --> 14:37.330
You shall pay every penny.

14:48.880 --> 14:50.590
[Jiang Yubai]

14:50.610 --> 14:52.690
[The alumni list of Nanhai No.1 High School
(mentions "Jiang Yubai")]

14:52.720 --> 14:53.940
[The Star of Hope—Provincial Math Contest]

14:53.960 --> 14:55.410
[Jiang Yubai won the first prize.]

14:58.810 --> 15:01.280
[Local News]

15:01.300 --> 15:05.840
[Master Jiang's Repair]

15:05.920 --> 15:06.480
[Master Jiang fixed
my grandpa's military-merit radio.]

15:06.510 --> 15:07.130
[He can listen to "Katyusha" once again.]

15:10.300 --> 15:11.270
Master Jiang fixed

15:11.270 --> 15:13.050
my grandpa's military-merit radio.

15:13.050 --> 15:15.250
He can listen to "Katyusha" once again.

15:15.630 --> 15:16.750
I saved up for 6 months

15:16.750 --> 15:18.770
and finally got
Master Jiang's handmade speaker.

15:18.770 --> 15:21.360
With sweet highs, accurate mids,
and powerful bass,

15:21.360 --> 15:24.290
it beats factory products
in the 10,000-yuan range.

15:24.340 --> 15:26.480
It's said that
Master Jiang was a legendary top student

15:26.480 --> 15:28.390
who refused Qingbei University
despite lowered requirements.

15:28.390 --> 15:29.670
Does anyone know why?

15:29.770 --> 15:30.970
I can't figure it out.

15:34.200 --> 15:35.550
Just forget it if you can't figure it out.

15:35.550 --> 15:36.650
College students are a dime a dozen,

15:36.650 --> 15:38.160
but craftsmen are scarce.

15:38.490 --> 15:40.020
Isn't it good to have a mechanical genius?

15:40.020 --> 15:41.630
They say
as long as you bring up a concept,

15:41.630 --> 15:42.630
Master Jiang can make anything.

15:42.630 --> 15:43.790
That's so amazing.

15:44.480 --> 15:46.740
He's basically like a human 3D printer.

15:47.550 --> 15:49.050
It's also said that he's very handsome

15:49.050 --> 15:50.320
but very short of money.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.750
Does anyone know why?

15:53.360 --> 15:55.680
[He's excellent in mechanics, processing,
and adjustment. It's just reasonable.]

16:11.960 --> 16:13.000
Cheng,

16:13.320 --> 16:14.520
about Jiang Yubai...

16:15.670 --> 16:16.950
I mean, Master Jiang.

16:18.080 --> 16:20.940
I'd like to know
what he's been through these years.

16:21.910 --> 16:23.200
Didn't I tell you to delete her contact?

16:23.200 --> 16:24.720
Why do you still keep it?

16:24.870 --> 16:26.440
Bro, I know your relationship.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.550
But she's our client.

16:27.550 --> 16:28.270
Of course, I have to keep it,

16:28.270 --> 16:28.870
in case of after-sales service...

16:28.870 --> 16:30.720
There is no after-sales service!

16:30.720 --> 16:32.050
I won't take her orders!

16:32.870 --> 16:33.870
Give me the phone.

16:34.750 --> 16:35.510
Bro.

16:35.510 --> 16:36.320
Give it to me!

16:45.700 --> 16:46.110
[Miss Lin]

16:46.140 --> 16:48.470
[Settings] [Delete Contact]

16:48.490 --> 16:49.680
[Deleting the contact, "Miss Lin"]

16:49.700 --> 16:51.040
[Loading]

16:51.080 --> 16:51.710
[Settings]

16:55.240 --> 16:56.030
Get out.

16:58.720 --> 16:59.480
Okay.

16:59.510 --> 17:00.840
I'll take my leave then.

18:29.440 --> 18:32.110
Guess what I brought you.

18:35.790 --> 18:38.550
This is from the restaurant
you said you really liked last time.

18:38.550 --> 18:39.680
It was freshly made,

18:39.680 --> 18:41.110
and I brought it over immediately

18:41.110 --> 18:42.790
without delaying for a single minute.

18:42.790 --> 18:43.720
Give it a try now.

18:45.160 --> 18:46.660
I don't like it anymore lately.

18:46.660 --> 18:47.510
I'm tired of it.

18:47.510 --> 18:48.240
Tired of it?

18:50.100 --> 18:51.870
Then what do you like to eat?

18:51.900 --> 18:53.900
I'll bring it over to you right away.

18:54.550 --> 18:56.030
Cut the small talk.

18:56.110 --> 18:57.310
Just cut to the chase.

19:00.550 --> 19:01.750
Well, um...

19:04.000 --> 19:04.790
Tang.

19:06.270 --> 19:07.070
Tingting.

19:09.310 --> 19:11.030
Madam Tang, Miss Tang.

19:11.960 --> 19:12.720
Look.

19:12.960 --> 19:14.920
I have a shared e-bike company,

19:14.920 --> 19:16.270
right?

19:16.270 --> 19:17.730
It's called "Fun Biking."

19:20.310 --> 19:21.270
This is it.

19:21.290 --> 19:23.650
It needs a bit of promotion lately.

19:24.160 --> 19:27.400
Well, we've known each other for years,

19:27.400 --> 19:29.400
and we're old friends.

19:29.880 --> 19:32.680
See if your company
has any suitable artists

19:32.700 --> 19:35.160
whom you can help us
discuss a collaboration

19:35.160 --> 19:36.580
or an endorsement with.

19:37.440 --> 19:39.750
Our artists are very expensive.

19:40.270 --> 19:42.160
That's exactly why I came to you!

19:42.590 --> 19:43.400
Look.

19:43.640 --> 19:45.510
Isn't our old classmates' friendship

19:45.510 --> 19:47.350
worth a million or so?

19:47.590 --> 19:48.400
Besides,

19:48.590 --> 19:51.050
if we really make
our collaboration happen,

19:51.400 --> 19:53.200
I will cover all the transportation needs

19:53.200 --> 19:54.790
of your company.

19:55.790 --> 19:57.840
Duan Qiyan, are you serious?

19:58.000 --> 19:59.890
We are a talent agency!

20:00.030 --> 20:01.720
What do we need your e-bikes for?

20:01.720 --> 20:02.750
Do you expect our artists

20:02.750 --> 20:05.480
to ride your e-bikes
to attend their work events?

20:06.170 --> 20:08.630
Your employees
can ride them as well, right?

20:13.920 --> 20:14.480
Hello?

20:14.720 --> 20:15.320
Tingting,

20:15.510 --> 20:17.590
I brought Mr. Wang
an iced Americano this afternoon.

20:17.590 --> 20:18.790
He was so happy

20:19.070 --> 20:21.000
and even helped me
refine my acting this afternoon.

20:21.000 --> 20:21.800
You know what?

20:22.070 --> 20:23.640
The directors all praised me today,

20:23.640 --> 20:25.070
saying that I captured the emotions well,

20:25.070 --> 20:26.400
and my eyes told the story.

20:26.400 --> 20:27.750
Great job!

20:27.750 --> 20:28.480
Keep it up.

20:28.480 --> 20:29.410
Don't get cocky.

20:29.550 --> 20:30.590
Tell me if anything happens.

20:30.590 --> 20:31.790
Okay, I got it.

20:31.830 --> 20:33.180
Tingting, I've got to go now.

20:33.180 --> 20:34.830
They're calling me. Bye-bye.

20:34.830 --> 20:35.360
Bye-bye.

20:37.960 --> 20:39.790
"Great job!"

20:40.720 --> 20:41.510
"Bye-bye."

20:43.480 --> 20:45.200
Tang, not bad.

20:45.680 --> 20:46.480
He is now

20:46.480 --> 20:48.810
giving you real-time updates on his work.

20:49.160 --> 20:50.400
That's why they say

20:50.400 --> 20:52.640
kids always behave well.

20:54.790 --> 20:55.590
Yeah,

20:55.750 --> 20:58.960
He is well-behaved and sensible.

20:59.720 --> 21:01.750
He follows my suggestions 100%,

21:01.750 --> 21:03.350
so of course things turn out well.

21:03.350 --> 21:04.880
Unlike you, Duan Qiyan.

21:05.270 --> 21:08.110
How many suggestions
have I given you since we were little?

21:08.110 --> 21:09.550
From choosing your college

21:09.550 --> 21:11.920
to starting a business
with shared e-bikes,

21:11.920 --> 21:14.240
have you ever listened
to a single piece of my advice?

21:14.240 --> 21:15.590
You always do the opposite

21:15.590 --> 21:16.650
and bicker with me.

21:16.680 --> 21:18.200
Why should I listen to you?

21:19.480 --> 21:21.510
Only a kid
who's still wet behind the ears like him

21:21.510 --> 21:23.370
would listen to whatever you say.

21:23.550 --> 21:24.310
I, Duan Qiyan,

21:24.310 --> 21:26.480
am a man with my own ideas and opinions.

21:26.790 --> 21:28.070
What's so great about getting resources

21:28.070 --> 21:29.470
by sweet-talking women?

21:30.240 --> 21:32.030
Then what did you come
to our company today?

21:32.030 --> 21:33.830
Isn't it just that your own company
is struggling,

21:33.830 --> 21:35.000
and you're here to piggyback on our fame?

21:35.000 --> 21:35.400
Hey...

21:35.410 --> 21:36.440
Duan Qiyan, listen.

21:36.440 --> 21:38.310
Your acting is terrible.

21:38.480 --> 21:40.790
Your fake flattery is so obvious.

21:40.790 --> 21:41.650
Tang Tingting!

21:42.070 --> 21:42.750
You...

21:46.310 --> 21:47.880
Don't take it too far.

21:48.160 --> 21:50.320
When have I, Duan Qiyan,
ever flattered anyone?

21:50.320 --> 21:52.310
This is called win-win cooperation.

21:52.310 --> 21:54.710
How could it be the same
as what that kid did?

21:54.880 --> 21:55.750
Listen.

21:55.920 --> 21:58.160
When I, Duan Qiyan,
look for a girlfriend in the future,

21:58.160 --> 22:00.790
I will find someone
who's completely the opposite of you.

22:00.790 --> 22:03.200
I'll find a woman
who's gentle, considerate,

22:03.200 --> 22:04.440
obedient,

22:04.440 --> 22:06.590
and submissive to me.

22:06.720 --> 22:08.310
Like the exact inverse function
of someone like you!

22:08.310 --> 22:10.120
Great, Duan Qiyan.

22:10.240 --> 22:13.240
I wish you find your gentle
and considerate inverse function soon.

22:13.240 --> 22:14.790
Now, take your great dream

22:14.790 --> 22:15.850
and get out of here.

22:16.110 --> 22:17.290
You want an endorsement?

22:17.290 --> 22:18.270
No way!

22:18.290 --> 22:19.240
Fine, whatever!

22:19.240 --> 22:20.590
I'm not doing it anyway!

22:30.680 --> 22:32.400
Stop being so pretentious.
You're tired of it?

22:32.400 --> 22:33.480
Take it or leave it!

22:48.010 --> 22:55.990
[Repayment plan for the next 3 months]

22:56.030 --> 23:05.310
[437,000 yuan] [+39,330/3 months]

23:07.680 --> 23:09.270
Master Jiang, have you eaten yet?

23:09.270 --> 23:10.600
I brought you a pancake.

23:11.200 --> 23:12.400
You really scared me yesterday.

23:12.400 --> 23:13.030
Cheng.

23:13.560 --> 23:15.090
Can we take more orders now?

23:18.110 --> 23:19.570
You want even more orders?

23:19.880 --> 23:20.790
No problem.

23:20.920 --> 23:22.310
With your great reputation,

23:22.310 --> 23:23.550
you can get as many as you want.

23:23.550 --> 23:24.350
However,

23:24.960 --> 23:27.290
won't that be too much for you physically?

23:28.400 --> 23:29.680
Besides audio equipment,

23:29.680 --> 23:30.960
I'll do any other work

23:30.960 --> 23:32.150
for electronic devices,

23:32.150 --> 23:33.680
smart home modifications,

23:34.110 --> 23:36.110
or industrial controller repairs.

23:40.400 --> 23:41.200
Master Jiang,

23:41.920 --> 23:42.790
this is weird.

23:43.750 --> 23:44.960
In view of your schedule,

23:44.960 --> 23:47.690
are you planning
to burn yourself out in 3 months?

23:48.830 --> 23:50.790
Why are you suddenly so fired up?

23:51.960 --> 23:54.430
Is it because of that Miss Lin
at the door last time?

23:54.430 --> 23:56.590
Did you two...

23:56.610 --> 23:58.210
It has nothing to do with her.

23:58.790 --> 23:59.650
Stop guessing.

24:00.590 --> 24:01.400
Man...

24:01.680 --> 24:03.160
You can fool others.

24:03.270 --> 24:04.200
But you can hardly

24:04.200 --> 24:04.830
fool me.

24:06.030 --> 24:07.510
I saw everything last time.

24:07.510 --> 24:10.000
She waited at the door
from dawn till dusk.

24:11.160 --> 24:11.920
Also,

24:11.920 --> 24:13.520
you texted me in such a panic,

24:14.110 --> 24:15.310
telling me to send her away immediately.

24:15.310 --> 24:17.440
She's obviously your ex-girlfriend.

24:18.000 --> 24:18.680
Look,

24:19.270 --> 24:21.640
you've been hiding
in this crappy warehouse for 5 years,

24:21.640 --> 24:23.930
living like an ascetic monk.

24:23.960 --> 24:26.890
You wouldn't even care about
a female cat passing by.

24:27.550 --> 24:29.790
But why is it that she showed up

24:30.590 --> 24:32.590
and suddenly you hid away and panicked?

24:32.590 --> 24:34.790
You even made me
delete her WeChat contact yesterday.

24:34.790 --> 24:36.350
Obviously, you still have
feelings for her,

24:36.350 --> 24:37.510
yet you're too afraid to see her,

24:37.510 --> 24:38.550
making yourself struggle

24:38.550 --> 24:39.440
in a dilemma.

24:39.510 --> 24:40.240
Am I right?

24:40.790 --> 24:41.590
Cheng.

24:43.200 --> 24:44.270
You still have a game console

24:44.270 --> 24:46.200
waiting for a new chip here, right?

24:47.310 --> 24:49.030
Leave right now

24:49.110 --> 24:51.400
and don't come back
until you get me 10 orders,

24:51.400 --> 24:52.200
or...

24:52.480 --> 24:54.310
I happen to be short
of a few high-end capacitors,

24:54.310 --> 24:55.720
which your game console
just happens to have.

24:55.720 --> 24:57.310
Alright, Master Jiang.

24:57.920 --> 24:59.070
I shouldn't have run my mouth.

24:59.070 --> 25:00.510
I'm going to get you orders right now.

25:00.510 --> 25:04.200
I promise you'll be soldering all day,
working your fingers to the bone.

25:04.200 --> 25:05.000
Bye-bye.

25:10.850 --> 25:15.630
[Repayment plan for the next 3 months]
[Go meet Lin Zhixia]

25:15.780 --> 25:23.890
[Sensor Technology Lab]

25:21.570 --> 25:22.250
Baihui.

25:22.740 --> 25:23.530
Mom, Dad.

25:24.140 --> 25:25.220
-Baihui.
-Baihui.

25:25.220 --> 25:26.420
What brings you here?

25:26.660 --> 25:28.320
We're here to pick you up to...

25:28.980 --> 25:29.810
Nothing.

25:29.900 --> 25:30.940
I just missed you

25:30.940 --> 25:31.900
and wanted to come to see you.

25:31.900 --> 25:33.290
You look tired from studying.

25:33.290 --> 25:34.740
We'll take you out for a nice meal tonight

25:34.740 --> 25:35.570
for nutrition.

25:35.570 --> 25:36.250
Okay.

25:36.250 --> 25:38.010
Look at you, you've lost weight again.

25:38.010 --> 25:39.810
How about we go to my dorm first,

25:39.810 --> 25:40.850
so I can put away my things?

25:40.850 --> 25:41.940
Okay, let's go.

25:41.940 --> 25:42.530
Which way?

25:42.530 --> 25:43.140
This way.

25:48.420 --> 25:50.350
Mom, Dad, come in and rest for a bit.

25:50.940 --> 25:52.460
So this is the grad student dorm?

25:52.460 --> 25:53.010
Yeah.

25:53.010 --> 25:54.420
It is different from the undergrad one.

25:54.420 --> 25:55.610
The lighting is great.

25:55.610 --> 25:56.850
I haven't had time to tidy up recently.

25:56.850 --> 25:58.420
It's a bit messy. Have a seat first.

25:58.420 --> 26:00.010
You live in such a big space alone?

26:00.010 --> 26:01.220
My roommate just moved out,

26:01.220 --> 26:03.150
and the new one hasn't moved in yet.

26:03.600 --> 26:05.560
So you're basically
living in a single room.

26:05.560 --> 26:06.200
Yeah.

26:07.050 --> 26:07.740
It's fine.

26:08.140 --> 26:09.600
Studying is the priority.

26:09.700 --> 26:10.460
Baihui.

26:11.500 --> 26:13.700
You can't spend all your time studying.

26:13.720 --> 26:14.850
You still need

26:14.850 --> 26:15.980
to have a life.

26:16.610 --> 26:18.180
I'm used to it.
Studying isn't tiring for me.

26:18.180 --> 26:19.140
That won't do.

26:19.180 --> 26:21.420
You need to get along well
with your classmates

26:21.420 --> 26:22.740
and make more friends.

26:23.330 --> 26:24.610
You might not see it at school,

26:24.610 --> 26:26.220
but once you graduate and enter society,

26:26.220 --> 26:27.770
you'll realize the importance of friends.

26:27.770 --> 26:28.460
Okay.

26:30.420 --> 26:32.250
Speaking of your classmates,

26:32.650 --> 26:34.810
do you guys interact

26:34.810 --> 26:35.700
with the philosophy department?

26:35.700 --> 26:37.090
The philosophy department

26:37.090 --> 26:38.570
doesn't have much interaction with us.

26:38.570 --> 26:40.100
I'm not familiar with them.

26:40.810 --> 26:43.530
I heard about a guy named Li Zhe.

26:43.610 --> 26:44.740
He's good at his studies

26:44.740 --> 26:45.980
and comes from a good family.

26:45.980 --> 26:47.440
Have you ever heard of him?

26:48.570 --> 26:49.500
I don't know him.

26:58.770 --> 26:59.500
Baihui.

27:00.850 --> 27:02.650
Let me just be straight with you.

27:02.740 --> 27:05.380
Do you remember
when your dad and I video-called you,

27:05.380 --> 27:07.240
and there were two madams with us?

27:08.660 --> 27:09.610
One of them

27:09.610 --> 27:10.900
is Li Zhe's mother.

27:11.570 --> 27:14.370
She said Li Zhe had
a really good impression of you.

27:15.010 --> 27:16.940
We're having dinner with them today.

27:16.940 --> 27:18.940
Yes, we're having dinner together.

27:20.330 --> 27:22.130
So we're eating with them today?

27:27.730 --> 27:29.790
Just for you to get to know each other.

27:33.290 --> 27:34.020
By the way...

27:35.770 --> 27:37.220
I also bought you a dress.

27:37.500 --> 27:38.220
Look.

27:38.770 --> 27:39.570
It's pretty.

27:39.740 --> 27:41.600
This really brings out your vibe.

27:42.250 --> 27:43.900
Change into it later, okay?

27:47.140 --> 27:48.530
Alright, Jin.

27:48.770 --> 27:50.610
Let's go first and let her get ready.

27:50.610 --> 27:51.700
Okay.

27:51.830 --> 27:53.690
I happen to have a paper to submit.

27:53.740 --> 27:54.810
I'll go in a bit.

27:54.810 --> 27:55.460
Okay.

27:55.700 --> 27:56.700
Don't be late.

27:57.460 --> 27:58.520
Put on some makeup.

28:02.330 --> 28:03.220
See you later.

28:14.550 --> 28:20.140
[Xinrong Wealth's scandal was exposed.
Its legal representative is on the run.]

28:35.570 --> 28:36.380
Hello, Mom.

28:37.420 --> 28:38.290
Did you eat?

28:38.510 --> 28:39.400
Yes, I did.

28:39.810 --> 28:40.610
What's wrong?

28:40.770 --> 28:41.810
Nothing.

28:42.770 --> 28:45.100
I just want to confirm something with you.

28:45.110 --> 28:47.670
[Xinrong Wealth's scandal was exposed.
Its legal representative is on the run.]

28:45.610 --> 28:46.740
That P2P online lending product

28:46.740 --> 28:47.870
we bought before...

28:48.440 --> 28:49.250
I mean the one

28:50.770 --> 28:52.290
Jiang Yubai's mom sold.

28:54.180 --> 28:55.340
How did it end up?

28:56.290 --> 28:58.090
Did they provide compensation?

28:59.160 --> 29:00.240
Oh, that thing.

29:00.550 --> 29:02.010
Yes, they did compensate.

29:02.330 --> 29:03.710
But we were lucky.

29:03.730 --> 29:05.290
We got all our principal back.

29:05.290 --> 29:07.020
The interest was gone for sure.

29:07.140 --> 29:09.700
I heard many people
didn't even get their principal back.

29:09.700 --> 29:10.980
It was so miserable.

29:12.470 --> 29:14.750
Is it called Xinrong Wealth?

29:16.530 --> 29:17.410
Let me think.

29:18.030 --> 29:19.980
Yes, that's it.

29:20.460 --> 29:22.070
Why the sudden question?

29:22.200 --> 29:23.730
Did you run into something?

29:23.810 --> 29:25.070
Are you short of money?

29:25.330 --> 29:26.000
No.

29:26.770 --> 29:28.330
I just saw a similar case

29:28.330 --> 29:29.460
on the news,

29:30.220 --> 29:31.660
so I asked.

29:32.640 --> 29:32.970
Okay.

29:33.900 --> 29:35.030
I won't keep you any longer.

29:35.030 --> 29:38.050
Zhixia, you must tell us
if something happens.

29:39.380 --> 29:40.050
Bye.

29:48.070 --> 29:51.210
[Xinrong Wealth's scandal was exposed.
Its legal representative is on the run.]

29:49.330 --> 29:51.570
He's basically like a human 3D printer.

29:52.660 --> 29:54.070
It's also said that he's very handsome

29:54.070 --> 29:55.400
but very short of money.

29:55.440 --> 29:56.790
Does anyone know why?

30:03.850 --> 30:05.010
Sorry, I'm late.

30:05.010 --> 30:05.850
Baihui, come here.

30:05.850 --> 30:07.150
Hello, Baihui.

30:07.290 --> 30:08.890
-Have a seat.
-Hello, madam.

30:09.420 --> 30:10.050
Sit down.

30:11.700 --> 30:12.530
Baihui,

30:12.570 --> 30:14.220
I heard you're so busy with your studies,

30:14.220 --> 30:15.900
yet you made a special trip here.

30:15.900 --> 30:16.700
It's nothing.

30:16.700 --> 30:17.460
Actually,

30:17.460 --> 30:20.980
we don't want her to spend all her time
studying at school either.

30:20.980 --> 30:21.770
Baihui,

30:22.250 --> 30:23.460
this is Li Zhe,

30:23.460 --> 30:24.330
your senior

30:24.420 --> 30:25.610
from the philosophy department.

30:25.610 --> 30:26.540
Nice to meet you.

30:28.140 --> 30:28.940
Baihui,

30:29.220 --> 30:32.280
Li Zhe always talks about you at home
with his dad and me,

30:32.610 --> 30:34.460
saying that you're an excellent student

30:34.460 --> 30:35.860
with a calm personality.

30:36.330 --> 30:37.900
We've finally met you today.

30:37.900 --> 30:39.660
You really are a wonderful girl.

30:39.660 --> 30:40.380
Thank you.

30:41.140 --> 30:42.980
This is also my first time meeting Li Zhe.

30:42.980 --> 30:44.050
He's also

30:44.050 --> 30:45.380
a handsome gentleman.

30:47.770 --> 30:49.570
Everyone, let's eat up.

30:49.900 --> 30:51.210
Baihui, have as much as you want.

30:51.210 --> 30:51.800
Okay.

30:51.820 --> 30:53.700
Li Zhe, take care of Baihui.

30:53.700 --> 30:54.050
Okay.

30:54.860 --> 30:55.680
By the way,

30:55.900 --> 30:56.550
Jin.

30:56.760 --> 30:58.620
Li wanted to come back today.

30:58.640 --> 30:59.240
Thank you.

30:59.240 --> 31:00.610
But he suddenly got called into a meeting.

31:00.610 --> 31:02.980
He told me to apologize to you

31:03.250 --> 31:05.770
and said he'd treat you
to a meal next time.

31:05.810 --> 31:07.220
Do you have any hobbies

31:07.250 --> 31:08.420
besides studying?

31:09.530 --> 31:11.050
I don't have many hobbies.

31:11.140 --> 31:12.980
Like me, I prefer outdoor sports

31:12.980 --> 31:15.290
and making friends
with like-minded people.

31:15.290 --> 31:17.750
We can have fun together
if there's a chance.

31:18.380 --> 31:20.510
I probably won't have much spare time.

31:25.010 --> 31:26.530
Look at Baihui.

31:26.980 --> 31:29.240
The more I look at her,
the more I like her.

31:30.290 --> 31:32.460
You've also raised Li Zhe so well.

31:32.460 --> 31:34.850
Look, he's also studying
at Qingbei University.

31:34.850 --> 31:37.570
Both of them are students
at Qingbei University.

31:37.570 --> 31:38.610
Yeah.

31:39.090 --> 31:39.940
In the future,

31:40.220 --> 31:43.350
their children will definitely
be even more excellent.

31:45.700 --> 31:46.570
From now on,

31:46.660 --> 31:47.850
we'll be one family.

31:47.850 --> 31:49.580
I won't treat you as outsiders.

31:49.610 --> 31:50.700
I'll take care

31:50.850 --> 31:51.940
of them.

31:51.940 --> 31:52.850
Don't worry.

31:54.380 --> 31:56.770
-Don't just talk. Come on, eat up.
-Since you're usually so busy,

31:56.770 --> 31:58.500
did you date anyone in college?

32:01.090 --> 32:01.740
Pardon?

32:01.810 --> 32:02.670
I mean, dating.

32:05.740 --> 32:06.700
Sorry,

32:06.850 --> 32:08.010
I'm just

32:08.570 --> 32:09.900
a straightforward person.

32:09.900 --> 32:11.500
If I said something that upset you,

32:11.500 --> 32:12.610
I didn't mean to.

32:15.810 --> 32:16.610
It's fine.

32:19.050 --> 32:21.090
I think you have
a really good personality.

32:21.090 --> 32:22.180
You are steadier than I am.

32:22.180 --> 32:23.710
If we are together someday,

32:23.850 --> 32:25.250
maybe

32:25.610 --> 32:27.010
the family social things

32:27.010 --> 32:28.570
could be left to you.

32:28.610 --> 32:30.610
I think you'd do a better job than me.

32:31.370 --> 32:32.700
Once Baihui marries into our family,

32:32.700 --> 32:34.810
you can rest assured.
You don't need to worry about anything.

32:34.810 --> 32:37.210
Just leave it all to me.
I'll take care of it.

32:37.570 --> 32:39.760
Let them focus on their work.

32:40.010 --> 32:41.940
Leave their children to me as well.

32:42.050 --> 32:43.710
I'll take care of everything.

32:44.050 --> 32:45.530
Come on, cheers.

32:46.420 --> 32:48.480
Let them get to know each other first.

32:48.500 --> 32:49.940
Yes,
let them get to know each other first.

32:49.940 --> 32:50.500
Okay.

32:50.500 --> 32:51.570
-Come on.
-Cheers.

32:52.990 --> 32:54.850
You probably don't drink, do you?

32:55.770 --> 32:56.810
Let's use tea

32:57.090 --> 32:58.140
instead of wine

32:58.380 --> 33:00.630
to make a toast to your parents

33:00.850 --> 33:01.780
and my mom later.

33:01.980 --> 33:04.640
After all, they've done so much
for the two of us.

33:05.330 --> 33:08.730
As the younger generation,
we should show our appreciation.

33:10.290 --> 33:11.500
Um, excuse me.

33:11.570 --> 33:13.230
I'm going to use the restroom.

33:17.090 --> 33:18.620
Let's enjoy the meal first.

33:18.940 --> 33:20.050
Eat more, Li Zhe.

33:20.050 --> 33:20.500
Okay.

33:20.500 --> 33:21.530
You're too thin.

